      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.77,
      "end_seconds": 3.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "hello, come in mind the step"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.01,
      "end_seconds": 6.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "Hello, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.09,
      "end_seconds": 9.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.18,
      "end_seconds": 18.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "Yeah, it's rapidly spreading redness on the thigh. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.04,
      "end_seconds": 23.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.98,
      "end_seconds": 28.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "It's been like this since last Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.09,
      "end_seconds": 35.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.06,
      "end_seconds": 49.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "nearly done with the readings.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.5,
      "end_seconds": 75.64,
      "duration_seconds": 12.14,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 37.1 degrees, BP is 103 over 60, pulse is 106 beats a minute, respiratory rate 18, oxygen saturation is 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.72,
      "end_seconds": 82.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.96,
      "end_seconds": 88.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "So, I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.46,
      "end_seconds": 92.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.45,
      "end_seconds": 95.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.18,
      "end_seconds": 115.34,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "The skin is dusky with blisters, there is a a crackling feeling under it and you are hypotensive."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.65,
      "end_seconds": 125.66,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Alright, did you get diarrhoea or recent cut?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.58,
      "end_seconds": 129.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.72,
      "end_seconds": 132.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "And cough, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.98,
      "end_seconds": 137.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, no cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.38,
      "end_seconds": 140.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.5,
      "end_seconds": 142.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.93,
      "end_seconds": 160.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.37,
      "end_seconds": 168.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "I had a caesarean for my second baby nine years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.87,
      "end_seconds": 172.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.72,
      "end_seconds": 176.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "My grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.71,
      "end_seconds": 189.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.56,
      "end_seconds": 201.38,
      "duration_seconds": 10.82,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.76,
      "end_seconds": 220.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.26,
      "end_seconds": 222.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "No, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.65,
      "end_seconds": 227.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.94,
      "end_seconds": 236.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.04,
      "end_seconds": 240.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.62,
      "end_seconds": 245.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "no, nothing at the moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.87,
      "end_seconds": 256.64,
      "duration_seconds": 9.77,
      "text": "okay, thinking it through, I can't pin this down yet we're looking at a possible necrotising soft tissue infection or severe cellulitis"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.59,
      "end_seconds": 260.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Is it it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.89,
      "end_seconds": 270.35,
      "duration_seconds": 8.46,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a possible necrotising soft tissue infection is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.43,
      "end_seconds": 305.18,
      "duration_seconds": 16.75,
      "text": "I'll request an urgent surgical review, it'll help with possible necrotising infection. You need emergency surgery and intravenous antibiotics, we are going now. Let's get you seen by the surgical team, I'll arrange the letter"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.44,
      "end_seconds": 311.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.96,
      "end_seconds": 327.23,
      "duration_seconds": 15.27,
      "text": "One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait. Let's review you straight away. How would you describe the plan, so we're on the same page?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.08,
      "end_seconds": 333.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "So, I come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.0,
      "end_seconds": 340.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.88,
      "end_seconds": 343.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.12,
      "end_seconds": 346.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
